@startuml
title Sequo API - WebSocket/STOMP Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Mobile Client\nCustomer/Merchant/Hub/Rider" as Mobile
actor "Admin Web" as Admin

rectangle "Spring WebSocket Endpoint\n/ws" as WsEndpoint {
  [JwtHandshakeInterceptor] as Handshake
  [StompAuthChannelInterceptor] as Auth
  [StompAuthorizationInterceptor] as Authorization
  [WebSocketPresenceService] as Presence
  [RealtimeDestinationPolicy] as DestPolicy
}

rectangle "Application Realtime Services" as Services {
  [RealtimeEventPublisher] as Publisher
  [RealtimePayloadRedactor] as Redactor
  [RiderRadarRealtimeService] as RiderRadar
  [BargainingRealtimeService] as Bargaining
  [RelayRealtimeService] as Relay
  [AdminOperationsRealtimeService] as AdminRealtime
}

queue "STOMP Broker\nsimple broker locally\nbroker relay in production" as Broker

database "PostgreSQL" as Db {
  [notification_messages] as Messages
  [notification_outbox] as Outbox
}

Mobile --> WsEndpoint : CONNECT\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
Admin --> WsEndpoint : CONNECT\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
Handshake --> Auth : validate token
Auth --> Presence : register session\napp family + device
Mobile --> Authorization : SUBSCRIBE/SEND
Authorization --> DestPolicy : role + ownership check
DestPolicy --> Broker : allow destination

Publisher --> Redactor : build recipient-safe envelope
Redactor --> Broker : send /user/queue or /topic
RiderRadar --> Broker : /user/queue/mission-offers\n/topic/rider-radar/{zone}
Bargaining --> Broker : /topic/bargaining/{sessionId}
Relay --> Broker : /topic/relay/{relayPointId}/parcels
AdminRealtime --> Broker : /topic/admin/operations
Publisher --> Messages : durable recovery history
Publisher --> Outbox : optional async notification work

Broker --> Mobile : MESSAGE
Broker --> Admin : MESSAGE

note bottom of Authorization
Every subscription is authorized.
Topic names are not security.
end note

@enduml
